  "details": "Hi,\n\nI attempted to use my Xbox controller on my Windows 11 desktop to operate the pin cameras in the camera menu, but it wouldn’t respond. I tested the controller on a second computer and experienced the same issue.\n\nThen this morning (Monday), a friend reached out asking if I knew why their controller also wasn’t working. Could you please clarify what’s going on? I haven’t seen any recent updates that would have affected controller functionality in VRChat.\n\nFor context, we’re the camera crew for Immersive X, which took place last week across VRChat and other social platforms. Reliable controller support is essential for our workflow, so any guidance would be greatly appreciated.\n\nThank you,\n\nCarlos Austin",
